  "body": "Positioned in one of the North Shore’s favourite seaside neighbourhoods, this family home is wonderfully placed for enjoying all that Campbells Bay has to offer. With Campbells Bay Primary directly across the road, the beach, Centennial Park and the tennis club all within an easy stroll, the location here is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nA clever floor plan works well for everyday family life, with two levels offering space and flexible living options. Downstairs, the double garage sits alongside a good-sized rumpus and bathroom, ideal for teenagers, guests, a home office or even a flatmate arrangement. Upstairs features two bedrooms, a family bathroom and a spacious living area flowing through to the modern kitchen and dining space. A conservatory is a lovely addition, extending the living space and providing a sunny spot to sit with a morning coffee while enjoying the sea views.\r\n\r\nOutside, the garden is low maintenance, so there’s more time to enjoy the things that make this location so appealing. Morning walks to the beach, a game of tennis or a stroll through Centennial Park- it doesn't get much better than this. For families, the schooling is a real plus, with Campbells Bay Primary across the road and zoning for Murrays Bay Intermediate and Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools.\r\n\r\nThis home ticks a lot of boxes - a great seaside neighbourhood, plenty of flexibility and a wonderfully easy lifestyle. The kind of place you can simply move in, settle down and enjoy. Call me for viewing times or to arrange a private inspection.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
